## Integration with Build System

The build system should:
1. Check for BJS file modifications
2. Automatically compile BJS files if needed
3. Update corresponding Vala files
4. Continue with normal Vala compilation

## ⚠️ FINAL WARNING

**ABSOLUTE RULE**: BJS files are the source of truth for UI components. 

**NEVER** edit generated Vala files directly - they will be overwritten and your changes will be lost.

**ALWAYS** edit BJS files and compile them using the `--bjs-munge` command.

**VIOLATION** of this rule will result in:
- Lost work
- Broken builds  
- Wasted time
- Code inconsistencies

**REMEMBER**: The AI will be instructed to flag any direct Vala file edits as critical errors when BJS files exist.